			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Had an aggregate amount of 50,000 options outstanding at December 31, 2022. Resigned as a director effective March&nbsp;20, 2023.</p>
