			<td style="width: 50%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>2023 Proxy Statement</b></td>
		</tr>

