			<b>position (a)</b></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 0.5%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: bottom; width: 3.2%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
