<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>SECURITY OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS AND MANAGEMENT</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; text-indent: 0pt;">As of August 22, 2023,&nbsp; based on Schedule 13G, Schedule 13D, and Section 16(a) filings, to the best of our knowledge, no person&nbsp;beneficially own more than 5% of the outstanding shares of our common stock, other than those included in the table below entitled "Security Ownership of Management".&nbsp;The following table sets forth the beneficial ownership of our common stock held as of August 22, 2023 by (1) each current director and nominee for director; (2) each of the named executive officers listed in the Summary Compensation Table included elsewhere in this Proxy Statement; and (3) by all current directors and executive officers as a group:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

