<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; text-indent: 0pt;">Fairfax, Virginia<br>
September 5, 2023</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; text-indent: 0pt;">Our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2022 (other than exhibits thereto) filed with the SEC, which provides additional information about us, is available on the Internet at <i>https://ir.wavedancer.com</i> and is available in paper form to beneficial owners of our common stock without charge upon written request to Gwen Pal, Secretary, WaveDancer, Inc., 12015 Lee Jackson Memorial Highway Ste 210, Fairfax, Virginia 22033.</p>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</p>

